            "review_title": "Review at Ovenmaru Chicken",
            "review_text": "Alan A\n1 contribution\n1\nWhat a taste!\nJan 2019 • Couples\nThe best roasted chicken ever. Me and my wife we ordered half a portion roasted cheese chicken whit chili sauce. The sauce was sweet and chili and it was so good, that i asked the waiter to give me the spoon to finish it up ;p .The manager was also very helpful and good english speaking to make our order. As the place is focused on Korean food, i think the flavours in this eating place are worth to visit. The location is also good, as it's across the park. For our first day in Ho Chi Minh and after two weeks in Vietnam, Overmaru Chicken place was lucky discovery.\nRead more\nWritten January 21, 2019",
